  "description": "An XrmToolBox plugin to audit, secure, and validate Microsoft Copilot Studio agents\nacross Power Platform / Dataverse environments.\n\nFeatures:\n• Dashboard — KPI cards and risk-ranked agent table with health colour coding\n• Agent Inventory — Full agent list with filter, owner info, auth mode, solution membership, and expandable bot components\n• Security Scanner — Automated 0-100 security score for every agent (SEC-01 No Auth, SEC-03 HTTP Actions, SEC-05 Orphaned Owner, SEC-07 Not in Solution) with per-issue remediation steps\n• Deployment Readiness — Four pre-deployment checks (DEP-01 through DEP-04) with optional target-org verification\n• ALM Diff — Side-by-side bot component comparison across two environments (Match / Content Differs / Missing in Target / Only in Target)\n\nRead-only — never writes to your environment.\nRequires Dataverse online with Copilot Studio enabled.",
