  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 — Initial release\n• Dashboard with KPI cards and risk-ranked agent table\n• Agent Inventory with real-time filter and component drill-down\n• Security Scanner with 4 checks and remediation steps\n• Deployment Readiness with optional target-org connection\n• ALM Diff for cross-environment component comparison",
